# my-project

> devbox project environment. Use `devbox status` to see running services, `devbox validate` to check project health, and `devbox docs llms-txt` to regenerate this index.

## Project

- Project: my-project
- Service: api (type: app) — API Server
- Service: db (type: infra)
- URL: http://api.local
- Host: api.local

## Commands

- build — build the project
- test — run tests

## Quick start

- `devbox status` — see what's running
- `devbox validate` — check project health
- `devbox info` — project overview
- `devbox docs llms-txt` — regenerate this index
- `devbox --help` — full command list

